<title>SPAIN: Yields at Spain's  3-, 10-yr auctions decline.</title>
<headline>Yields at Spain's  3-, 10-yr auctions decline.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE Yield Pvs Price Pvs Bid Allocated</p>
<p> 3-year 5.164   5.516   105.20  103.80  529.36   150.00</p>
<p>10-year 6.599   6.753   106.80  105.10  319.53   172.12</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
